
# 🔐 45-Day Cybersecurity Training Diary

## 📌 About This Repository

This repository documents my 45-day cybersecurity training journey. During this training, I focused on understanding computer networking fundamentals, learning Linux commands, exploring network reconnaissance, and developing a foundation in cybersecurity.

**Training Domain:** Cybersecurity  
**Duration:** 45 Days  
**Primary Topics:** Networking, Linux, Network Scanning, and Cybersecurity Fundamentals  
**Tools:** Linux, Terminal, Nmap, and VirtualBox (where used)

---

